  "title": "Eggnog Cheesecake",
  "description": "This eggnog cheesecake with a decadent cream cheese and eggnog filling on a graham cracker crust makes the perfect festive dessert for eggnog lovers!",
  "authors": [
    "Bill Sinclair"
  ],
