  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup graham cracker crumbs",
    "3 tablespoons melted butter",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "3 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.75 cup eggnog",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 tablespoons rum",
    "1 pinch ground nutmeg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crust: Mix graham cracker crumbs, melted butter, and sugar together in a medium bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/44bNawJLHNOyVM0rTW1cmDaCJB8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-02-b006b85d21f640e4a56b7aa79e56c3da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press graham mixture into the bottom of a 9-inch springform pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8JNQkveEznYv1bwRWfIlPkmqCxs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-03-dfd7da69c8aa499d954b95366b6e56ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 10 minutes; transfer the pan to a wire rack and allow crust to cool. Increase the oven temperature to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v9t6sPespPJxZM7MTS4uG9_qScI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-04-efbcc97185df40b6a1ec25e13c03cb74.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the crust is cooling, make the filling: Combine cream cheese, sugar, eggnog, and flour in a food processor; process until smooth. Blend in eggs, rum, and nutmeg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6n76qZWLxJtzCiT-HeqbvAny-E8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-05-b5a4b52178184e8198e9828feda7ecf0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour eggnog mixture into cooled crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ztaYJEhPnGUgbkjmHpbd60TwJgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-07copy-92ef3fdf278b4869bebbed526569d019.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 10 minutes. Reduce the heat to 250 degrees F (120 degrees C) and continue to bake until edges are puffed and surface is firm except for a small spot in the center that will jiggle when the pan is gently shaken, about 45 minutes. Loosen the sides of the springform pan; let cheesecake cool before removing the rim completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wwS2dB-3KEceyR3QJGM67GY-1ok=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-step-08-469c02694f164987b34f7d5138e783ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6YsbFrdht6kFqDL5RxH5vUym49o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24308-eggnog-cheesecake-iii-DDMFS-4x3-3aebd08dc11d48018debd873456d3d7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24308/step_08.webp"
